WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.009 --> 00:00:02.609
Find and replace

2
00:00:03.117 --> 00:00:11.954
Find and replace is on the tool rail to the right of the page.

3
00:00:11.957 --> 00:00:19.762
Matches light up in the chapter. Step through them with the arrows.

4
00:00:19.764 --> 00:00:27.517
Switch to Whole book to search every chapter at once, with a count for each.

5
00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:35.582
Type the new wording, then replace one at a time or all at once.

6
00:00:35.584 --> 00:00:39.545
Tick Match the whole word or Match case to narrow it down.
